  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "<p>宜家经典的PO&Auml;NG 波昂 摇椅专为阳仔配备，让他慵懒地边摇边晒太阳，享受阳光的轻抚。</p>",
    "pub-text",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b8/1c/b81c757d5f3f3d180f48ac99dd2ba5ec.png"
   ],
