   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>对面的原木色柜子用来收纳杂物，下方开出的小门能够让猫咪随意进入，给它打造第二个休息空间。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a6/72/a6725a7e5db77ebfc88cfe869d60e8cc.png"
